<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16820" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσυν-ήθης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
		gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unaccustomed,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῶρος, τόπος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				118
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				16.19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					2.50
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσύνηθες τοῖς ζῴοις τὸ πίνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					606b26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαντασία ἀ. πράγματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Stoic.</u>
					3.98
				</span></i>
			, al.; <i>not customary,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπερ οὐκ ἀσύνηθες ὀνομάζειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>D.</u>
					3.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of persons,
				<i>unaccustomed, inexperienced,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				2.49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.47.7
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.678a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unfamiliar,</i> of persons, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1126b26
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἀνδράσιν ἀ.</span> amongst
			men <i>unknown to them,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				8.44
			</span></i>.</div>
